        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2135, Square Privacy Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Privacy Square Tubular Pocket Door Set has a 2-in-1 tubular latch with pop-out edge pull. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. This sliding door set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. This Square Privacy Pocket Door Hardware is 2-1/2 inches x 2-1/2 inches with a modern styled privacy turn to engage the latch. A privacy function locks but can be easily unlocked from the outside via an emergency turn on the exterior plate. Choose from one of the finish options including popular colors like oil rubbed bronze, black, and brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Function:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. It features a pop out edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket as well as a strike with dust box to receive the latch.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-square-pocket-door-set-emtek-2136\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/passage-square-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2134\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Square Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection off Door: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2135-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek 2135 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a pop-out edge pull, a privacy strike, dust box, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
